y five seconds to live.'),(30897,2,0,'enUS','Unknown. Data suggests that impetus for global combat originated with prime designate Loken, who neutralized all remaining Aesir and Vanir, affecting termination of conflict. Prime designate Loken then initiated stasis of several seed races, including earthen, giants and vrykul, at designated holding facilities.'),(30897,1,0,'enUS','Additional background is relevant to your query: following global combat between Aesir and Vanir--'),(19710,4,0,'enUS','%s raises his hammer menacingly...'),(30840,2,0,'enUS','We\'re done here. I\'m out.'),(30840,0,0,'enUS','Say hello to my little friend!'),(30840,1,0,'enUS','Arise, Melt!'),(30839,1,0,'enUS','Anything else you need help with before I go? Right, I thought not...'),(30839,0,0,'enUS','Too weak to finish your own battles? Very well then...'),(30838,1,0,'enUS','I will see you back at the Valley of Echoes. Suffer well, ally.'),(30385,3,0,'enUS','I give myself to the master!'),(30838,0,0,'enUS','You challenge death itself! Come then, \"King.\" Face the might of Mograine!'),(30385,2,0,'enUS','I have been chosen!'),(30385,0,0,'enUS','I have been chosen!'),(30385,1,0,'enUS','I give myself to the master!'),(30284,1,0,'enUS','%s becomes enraged!'),(30284,0,0,'enUS','%s becomes enraged!'),(30116,0,0,'enUS','As the leader of the Sunreavers, it is with great pride that I present $n as the new bearer of Quel\'Delar!'),(29573,1,0,'enUS','As the last remnants of the %s seep into the ground, the altar set into the floor nearby begins to glow faintly.'),(30115,0,0,'enUS','This is a great day for all who oppose the Lich King! Brave $n has taken up the ancient blade, Quel\'Delar, in the name of the Silver Covenant!'),(29573,0,0,'enUS','%s gathers its mojo and surges forward!'),(29311,7,0,'enUS','They do not die; they do not live. They are outside the cycle.'),(29311,6,0,'enUS','Ywaq maq oou; ywaq maq ssaggh. Ywaq ma shg\'fhn.'),(29311,5,0,'enUS','Gaze into the void. It is the perpetuity in which th